Third-party notices
--------------------------------------------------------------------------

LiMusic — https://github.com/SimoHypers/limusic
Copyright (C) SimoHypers and contributors. Licensed GPL-3.0.

Sable HUD's Music widget links to a separately installed LiMusic through
LiMusic's own local command interface. Sable starts LiMusic with a loopback-only
WebView2 DevTools port and calls the same typed commands LiMusic's own interface
uses, alongside LiMusic's Windows media session. No LiMusic source code is included
in this repository or binary, and LiMusic is not bundled. LiMusic is a separate
GPL-3.0 application.

NAudio — https://github.com/naudio/NAudio
Copyright (C) Mark Heath and contributors. MIT License. Used for Core Audio
enumeration/volume and Media Foundation file playback.

TagLib# — https://github.com/mono/taglib-sharp
Copyright (C) TagLib# contributors. GNU LGPL-2.1. Used to read local music tags
and embedded artwork.

WinAudioRoute — https://github.com/kunkunkunQoQ/WinAudioRoute
MIT License. Used for per-app audio output routing through the Windows
AudioPolicyConfig API. The API is undocumented by Microsoft and is probed at
runtime; Sable falls back to the Windows mixer if a build does not support it.

HidHide — https://github.com/nefarius/HidHide
Copyright (C) 2020 Eric Korff de Gidts, 2021-2024 Benjamin Höglinger-Stelzer.
MIT License. Optional controller isolation driver. The installer is bundled at
drivers\HidHide_1.5.230_x64.exe and is only launched from Settings when the
user chooses to install it. It is not required by Sable.

